1
00:01:44,312 --> 00:01:45,980
Tak boleh dimaafkan.

2
00:01:46,481 --> 00:01:48,399
Bilik saya...

3
00:01:49,859 --> 00:01:51,653
Maksud saya, kuil saya...

4
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:58,201
Haiwan peliharaan saya...

5
00:02:00,328 --> 00:02:02,747
Maksud saya, hamba saya...

6
00:02:06,417 --> 00:02:08,335
Kamu akan terima balasannya...

7
00:02:08,336 --> 00:02:10,796
Kamu patung hidup saya!

8
00:02:10,797 --> 00:02:13,550
<i>Livedoll!</i>

9
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:23,226
<i>"Musnahkan Taman Mini
Melarikan Diri Dari Negara Blok!"</i>

10
00:02:24,769 --> 00:02:27,647
Berani kamu musnahkan negara saya?

11
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:31,109
Tak dapat dimaafkan.

12
00:02:32,902 --> 00:02:35,154
Apa yang Tuan Iscat sedang buat?

13
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:37,824
Dewa Matahari! Tolong bertenang!

14
00:02:46,666 --> 00:02:47,958
Tengok!

15
00:02:47,959 --> 00:02:50,085
Di langit sana! Api itu!

16
00:02:50,086 --> 00:02:52,796
Jika kita tak buat apa-apa,
negara ini akan musnah!

17
00:02:52,797 --> 00:02:55,257
Dunia ini akan berakhir!

18
00:02:55,258 --> 00:02:57,467
Saya tak akan benarkan kamu lari!

19
00:02:57,468 --> 00:02:59,928
Mari sini!

20
00:02:59,929 --> 00:03:02,639
Dia memang menakutkan!

21
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:05,976
Dewa? Dia lebih kepada syaitan.

22
00:03:05,977 --> 00:03:07,854
Si celaka itu.

23
00:03:12,609 --> 00:03:14,526
Arah mana?

24
00:03:14,527 --> 00:03:16,571
Kanan!

25
00:03:18,406 --> 00:03:20,283
Iscat.

26
00:03:22,410 --> 00:03:23,828
Situ pun awak!

27
00:03:28,541 --> 00:03:30,168
Jangan lari!

28
00:03:31,169 --> 00:03:33,253
Hei, tengok Luffy! Ada pekan!

29
00:03:33,254 --> 00:03:34,338
Ya!

30
00:03:34,339 --> 00:03:36,256
Curam betul bukit ini. Boleh lepaskah?

31
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:39,302
Dia buat semua ini dengan blok?

32
00:03:39,886 --> 00:03:41,428
Hebat sekali!

33
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:44,015
Ini bukan masa untuk kagum!

34
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:49,519
Alamak! Dia akan dapat kejar!

35
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,021
Apa kita nak buat? Pusing?

36
00:03:51,022 --> 00:03:51,980
Saya akan potong dia.

37
00:03:51,981 --> 00:03:53,482
Tak, saya nak tendang sampai hancur.

38
00:03:53,483 --> 00:03:54,359
Tidak...

39
00:03:56,152 --> 00:03:57,611
Kita terhempas nanti!

40
00:03:57,612 --> 00:03:59,739
Kita akan terhempas!

41
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:03,534
Lompat, kucing!

42
00:04:06,412 --> 00:04:07,538
Tuan Iscat?

43
00:04:19,175 --> 00:04:21,218
{\an8}Dia banyak berusaha untuk buat ini.

44
00:04:21,219 --> 00:04:23,680
Kita cuba tak musnahkannya
sewaktu cuba lari!

45
00:04:29,894 --> 00:04:31,771
Dia terhenti!

46
00:04:39,737 --> 00:04:41,114
Hei, kucing!

47
00:04:42,949 --> 00:04:45,117
Awak okeykah, Nami?

48
00:04:45,118 --> 00:04:47,160
Terima kasih, Sanji.

49
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:48,746
Lepaskan saya.

50
00:04:49,497 --> 00:04:50,957
Awak pun.

51
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:54,961
Aduhai... Awak dah rosakkannya.

52
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:57,422
Itu sebab saya cakap nak potong saja dia.

53
00:04:58,006 --> 00:05:00,299
Benda sudah jadi.

54
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,634
Lepas ini, hati-hati!

55
00:05:06,431 --> 00:05:09,809
Sungguh cuai sekali.

56
00:05:11,269 --> 00:05:14,855
Jenayahnya adalah musnahkan
dunia saya cipta.

57
00:05:14,856 --> 00:05:16,774
Tak dapat dimaafkan!

58
00:05:18,526 --> 00:05:19,444
Dia datang!

59
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,613
Baiklah!

60
00:05:25,867 --> 00:05:27,535
Lari, kucing!

61
00:05:35,501 --> 00:05:37,210
Iscat!

62
00:05:37,211 --> 00:05:40,715
Kenapa awak bantu mereka?

63
00:05:41,924 --> 00:05:44,052
Berhenti!

64
00:05:48,931 --> 00:05:51,641
Kucing ini akan bawa kita
ke hujung dengan cepat.

65
00:05:51,642 --> 00:05:52,559
Apa?

66
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,519
Namun, ia seperti tak berpenghujung.

67
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:58,482
Aduhai Luffy.
Tengok sajalah cetak biru itu...

68
00:05:58,483 --> 00:06:01,486
Tidak! Awak nak buat apa?

69
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,696
Tak apa, saya ingat segalanya!

70
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,991
Yakah?

71
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:11,953
Tengok, Luffy.

72
00:06:11,954 --> 00:06:14,623
Pintu cermin kita nampak tadi
dipantulkan dari situ.

73
00:06:14,624 --> 00:06:16,083
Betul kata awak.

74
00:06:16,084 --> 00:06:19,212
Bila lihat betul-betul,
awan itu cuma kapas yang tergantung.

75
00:06:25,426 --> 00:06:27,428
Betullah.

76
00:06:28,638 --> 00:06:32,599
Sekalipun ia nampak luas,
ia masih cuma bilik gergasi.

77
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:37,062
Dengan cermin di segala arah,
patutlah ia nampak tak berpenghujung.

78
00:06:37,063 --> 00:06:38,897
Jadi, kita boleh ke sana dengan cepat.

79
00:06:38,898 --> 00:06:40,650
Sekarang, jalan terus.

80
00:06:41,275 --> 00:06:43,486
Kita dah separuh jalan
merentasi negara ini.

81
00:06:44,904 --> 00:06:46,697
Tak lama lagi, sampailah.

82
00:06:47,198 --> 00:06:48,783
Begitu.

83
00:06:50,868 --> 00:06:53,453
Kamu fikir yang kamu tahu
segalanya tentang dunia ini

84
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:55,580
hanya dengan melihat
cetak birunya, <i>gozaru?</i>

85
00:06:55,581 --> 00:06:58,709
Dia bercakap macam samurai?

86
00:06:59,293 --> 00:07:03,505
Tapi, ini dahulunya penjara untuk Gergasi.

87
00:07:03,506 --> 00:07:04,382
Jaring?

88
00:07:06,175 --> 00:07:08,928
Jika tertangkap,
entah apa dia buat pada kita!

89
00:07:09,512 --> 00:07:11,514
Cepat pergi ke dinding!

90
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:17,562
Tempat ini direka

91
00:07:18,146 --> 00:07:21,566
untuk mengurung Gergasi.
Kamu fikir yang kamu...

92
00:07:31,033 --> 00:07:33,118
Tak guna!

93
00:07:33,119 --> 00:07:34,745
Itu salah awak sendiri!

94
00:07:37,165 --> 00:07:40,251
Sekalipun kamu sampai ke dinding,

95
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:44,881
kamu tak mampu pecahkannya!

96
00:07:51,846 --> 00:07:55,098
Tambahan pula, sekalipun kamu
ke situ, ia cuma jalan mati, <i>gozaru.</i>

97
00:07:55,099 --> 00:07:56,308
Alamak!

98
00:07:56,309 --> 00:07:57,392
Apa kita nak buat?

99
00:07:57,393 --> 00:07:59,102
Kita dah begitu hampir.

100
00:07:59,103 --> 00:08:01,105
{\an8}Hei, kenapa tak elak, kucing?

101
00:08:05,776 --> 00:08:07,777
Kenapa ini berlaku pada Tuan Iscat?

102
00:08:07,778 --> 00:08:09,738
Siapa orang di atasnya?

103
00:08:09,739 --> 00:08:13,492
Mari ikut saya, <i>Livedoll</i> tak guna.

104
00:08:13,493 --> 00:08:16,871
Kembalilah pada saya.

105
00:08:25,129 --> 00:08:26,464
Kamu...

106
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:30,593
teruskan saja!

107
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:46,567
Pergi!

108
00:08:48,945 --> 00:08:51,781
Mari sini, Iscat!

109
00:08:52,365 --> 00:08:55,826
Mereka potong jaring besi?

110
00:09:00,831 --> 00:09:03,917
Tak kira sejauh mana pun kamu berusaha,

111
00:09:03,918 --> 00:09:06,294
keadaannya tak akan berubah!

112
00:09:06,295 --> 00:09:09,756
Awak pun tahu, bukan, Iscat?

113
00:09:09,757 --> 00:09:12,009
Hukuman bagi khianat sangat dahsyat!

114
00:09:15,763 --> 00:09:17,806
Dia cakap, "Diamlah dan jangan mengarut!"

115
00:09:17,807 --> 00:09:21,184
Apa? Berani awak cakap
pada tuan awak begitu?

116
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:25,773
Namun, usaha itu sia-sia saja disebabkan
Dewa Telinga yang ganas di depan!

117
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:29,443
Berhenti, Tuan Iscat!

118
00:09:30,903 --> 00:09:32,446
Dewa Matahari!

119
00:09:32,947 --> 00:09:35,657
Kami ada berita tentang Dewa Telinga.

120
00:09:35,658 --> 00:09:38,578
Dia mati dalam kebakaran hari ini
atas sebab misteri.

121
00:09:39,203 --> 00:09:42,497
Sewaktu kami rasa ia cukup tragis
dan bernasib malang,

122
00:09:42,498 --> 00:09:45,208
langit pula merekah secara misteri!

123
00:09:45,209 --> 00:09:47,752
{\an8}Istana Bigstein juga telah rosak teruk.

124
00:09:47,753 --> 00:09:49,421
{\an8}Tuan Iscat pula dah naik gila!

125
00:09:49,422 --> 00:09:51,674
Hari ini memang malang!

126
00:09:53,009 --> 00:09:54,594
<i>Adakah mereka yang tumpaskannya?</i>

127
00:09:55,094 --> 00:09:56,845
<i>Tak mungkin!</i>

128
00:09:56,846 --> 00:10:00,349
<i>Arnab ganas, Glut-Bunny, dikalahkan?</i>

129
00:10:03,144 --> 00:10:07,773
Sewaktu kami sedar, ini saja yang tinggal...

130
00:10:14,739 --> 00:10:17,241
Tolong tahan amarah kamu!

131
00:10:20,286 --> 00:10:22,079
Tolong bertenang...

132
00:10:27,627 --> 00:10:29,837
Dewa Matahari?

133
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:32,673
Bagus sekali!

134
00:10:33,924 --> 00:10:37,136
Begitu bernilai!
Beginilah bagaimana dunia berfungsi!

135
00:10:38,596 --> 00:10:42,432
Drama tak dijangka
di dalam taman mini tertutup.

136
00:10:42,433 --> 00:10:46,312
Saya dah pandang rendah mereka!
Ini betul-betul buat saya teruja, <i>gozaru.</i>

137
00:10:47,647 --> 00:10:50,106
Dalam dunia yang saya cipta,

138
00:10:50,107 --> 00:10:52,567
kejahatan dan wira dilahirkan,

139
00:10:52,568 --> 00:10:55,278
dan sejarah akan mula terpahat!

140
00:10:55,279 --> 00:11:00,034
Livedoll akan menambah pahit manis menarik
dalam dunia mini saya!

141
00:11:04,497 --> 00:11:06,624
Kenapa dia ketawa?

142
00:11:34,568 --> 00:11:37,613
Mungkinkah ini saja peluang kita?

143
00:11:38,447 --> 00:11:40,616
Jalan keluar sudah terbuka!

144
00:11:42,034 --> 00:11:43,619
Kita perlu bergerak sekarang.

145
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,830
Beritahu semua!

146
00:11:46,872 --> 00:11:51,126
Pergelutan! Semuanya dalam tangan saya!

147
00:11:51,127 --> 00:11:55,047
Sekalipun Hajrudin memandang tinggi awak,
saya tidak begitu!

148
00:12:02,012 --> 00:12:02,847
<i>Hajrudin?</i>

149
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,809
Celaka ini...

150
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:08,811
Siapa dia?

151
00:12:11,939 --> 00:12:13,148
Jadi,

152
00:12:13,149 --> 00:12:15,067
apa rancangan awak seterusnya?

153
00:12:17,862 --> 00:12:19,989
Dinding itu ada
di belakang pokok besar itu!

154
00:12:20,698 --> 00:12:23,199
Namun, bagaimana kita nak keluar?

155
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,201
Jika dia tangkap kita lagi, habislah kita.

156
00:12:25,202 --> 00:12:26,579
Saya tak akan benarkan dia!

157
00:12:28,164 --> 00:12:29,790
Ia dalam sasaran!

158
00:12:32,084 --> 00:12:34,211
Serangan Istimewa Bintang Hijau!

159
00:12:35,754 --> 00:12:37,882
Bom Rumput Tengkorak!

160
00:13:13,959 --> 00:13:16,295
Kita rosakkan lebih banyak lagi...

161
00:13:17,463 --> 00:13:19,839
Hei! Maaflah!

162
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,424
Peduli apa?

163
00:13:21,425 --> 00:13:24,052
Saya pedulilah!
Awak musnahkan banyak sangat!

164
00:13:24,053 --> 00:13:26,554
Baiklah! Salah saya!

165
00:13:26,555 --> 00:13:28,139
Baguslah awak faham.

166
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:31,434
Apa pun, Luffy.
Saya dah pecahkan cermin itu,

167
00:13:31,435 --> 00:13:33,728
namun dindingnya agak kukuh.

168
00:13:33,729 --> 00:13:35,647
Betul.

169
00:13:35,648 --> 00:13:38,149
Kamu tak akan boleh pecahkannya.

170
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:40,569
Mustahil untuk lari dari sini.

171
00:13:42,488 --> 00:13:44,823
Baguslah! Ini sangat bagus, <i>gozaru</i>!

172
00:13:45,449 --> 00:13:47,784
Patung yang tak terdaya cuba
melawan takdir mereka!

173
00:13:47,785 --> 00:13:50,120
Ini yang saya paling suka!
Ini episod terbaik!

174
00:13:54,375 --> 00:13:57,335
Kekosongan dan kegagalan
yang menjadikan dunia ini.

175
00:13:57,336 --> 00:13:59,629
Halangan dan penolakan

176
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:01,882
juga sebahagian dari sejarah!

177
00:14:02,383 --> 00:14:06,262
Awak merepek apa?

178
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:09,473
Hei, kucing, awak boleh lari lagi?

179
00:14:19,316 --> 00:14:20,400
Pergi, kucing!

180
00:14:20,401 --> 00:14:21,442
Cepatlah!

181
00:14:21,443 --> 00:14:23,111
Dia datang!

182
00:14:23,112 --> 00:14:24,404
Lari, kucing!

183
00:14:24,405 --> 00:14:26,573
Tak boleh laju lagi?

184
00:14:26,574 --> 00:14:28,616
- Dia akan dapat kejar!
- Biar saya potong dia.

185
00:14:28,617 --> 00:14:30,494
- Saya tendang dia.
- Kucing.

186
00:14:31,704 --> 00:14:33,288
Dia cakap, "Diamlah!"

187
00:14:33,289 --> 00:14:36,332
Lemah dan menyedihkan!
Namun begitu berani!

188
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:38,167
Saya betul-betul dapat rasakan!

189
00:14:38,168 --> 00:14:40,378
Baguslah kamu semua di sini!

190
00:14:40,379 --> 00:14:41,755
Luffy Ultrajarang!

191
00:14:42,590 --> 00:14:43,673
Zoro Ultrajarang!

192
00:14:43,674 --> 00:14:45,258
Sanji Ultrajarang!

193
00:14:45,259 --> 00:14:46,551
Usopp Ultrajarang!

194
00:14:46,552 --> 00:14:47,468
Saya?

195
00:14:47,469 --> 00:14:48,846
Chopper Ultrajarang!

196
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:50,722
Nami Ultrajarang!

197
00:14:50,723 --> 00:14:51,807
Sekejap!

198
00:14:52,391 --> 00:14:54,684
Macam mana dia tahu kita siapa?

199
00:14:54,685 --> 00:14:56,103
Apa maksud dia, "Ultrajarang"?

200
00:15:06,238 --> 00:15:07,947
Apa yang dia buat?

201
00:15:07,948 --> 00:15:12,035
Apa pun, kita nak buat apa?
Dia akan dapat kejar kita begini!

202
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,995
Hei, Usopp.

203
00:15:13,996 --> 00:15:16,831
Bencana alam bukan salah sesiapa, bukan?

204
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:20,835
Apa? Ya, contohnya gempa bumi,
banjir dan panahan petir,

205
00:15:20,836 --> 00:15:22,796
kita tak boleh salahkan sesiapa.

206
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:27,468
Kita berdepan
pengalaman menakutkan, bukan?

207
00:15:32,598 --> 00:15:34,766
Jujurnya, orang itu...

208
00:15:34,767 --> 00:15:35,601
menjengkelkan saya!

209
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:38,603
Saya tahu, tapi dia Gergasi
dan kita tak boleh...

210
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:40,063
Saya faham, Nami.

211
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:44,109
Tentang kekecewaan awak.
Orang itu buat saya marah juga.

212
00:15:44,610 --> 00:15:46,444
Sebab saya ada terfikir yang

213
00:15:46,445 --> 00:15:47,655
si celaka itu

214
00:15:48,238 --> 00:15:51,325
{\an8}telah tukar baju awak!

215
00:15:54,370 --> 00:15:55,703
Mari serang dia.

216
00:15:55,704 --> 00:15:58,790
Tidak, tunggu sekejap, Sanji!
Dengar sini!

217
00:15:58,791 --> 00:16:00,917
Saya tak nak dengar cakap sesiapa!

218
00:16:00,918 --> 00:16:03,127
Ini tak bagus, Sanji.

219
00:16:03,128 --> 00:16:04,420
Kenapa, Nami?

220
00:16:04,421 --> 00:16:05,923
Sebab saya percaya

221
00:16:06,423 --> 00:16:08,342
hukuman suci sedang menghampiri.

222
00:16:34,284 --> 00:16:36,620
Muginn, kenapa, <i>gozaru?</i>

223
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:39,540
Apa awak bawa balik kali ini, <i>gozaru?</i>

224
00:16:50,259 --> 00:16:52,844
Hei! Itu Lanun Topi Jerami!

225
00:16:52,845 --> 00:16:56,556
Kru Lanun Gergasi patutnya
pergi jemput mereka sekarang.

226
00:16:56,557 --> 00:16:59,059
Mana awak jumpa mereka, <i>gozaru?</i>

227
00:17:00,269 --> 00:17:03,938
Ada sesiapa tahu?
Mereka tidur nyenyak nampaknya.

228
00:17:03,939 --> 00:17:06,899
Adakah mereka melepasi Kabus Tidur

229
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:08,485
sewaktu dalam perjalanan dari Egghead?

230
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:15,117
Apa pun, ini sangat bertuah sekali!

231
00:17:15,701 --> 00:17:18,328
Lanun Topi Jerami...

232
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:24,876
Jujurnya, bila saya dengar Hajrudin
telah jadi orang bawahan dia tanpa sebab,

233
00:17:24,877 --> 00:17:26,712
saya rasa begitu marah!

234
00:17:29,048 --> 00:17:30,590
Hei, tunggu, Hajrudin!

235
00:17:30,591 --> 00:17:32,968
Saya dengar berita itu! Awak sudah gila?

236
00:17:34,011 --> 00:17:36,721
Memandangkan saya
ahli Lanun Pahlawan Gergasi Baharu,

237
00:17:36,722 --> 00:17:38,431
saya juga terpaksa jadi orang bawahan dia!

238
00:17:38,432 --> 00:17:40,850
Pahlawan Elbaf adalah yang
paling kuat di dunia!

239
00:17:40,851 --> 00:17:43,269
Kenapa kami perlu tunduk
pada manusia kerdil?

240
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:46,732
Mereka tak ada maruahkah?

241
00:17:47,816 --> 00:17:50,693
Tengoklah, dia kecil dan nampak lemah!

242
00:17:50,694 --> 00:17:53,655
Dia tidur nyenyak dan nampak rapuh.
Menyedihkan betul!

243
00:17:59,536 --> 00:18:03,415
Ini... Yang saya suka!

244
00:18:04,333 --> 00:18:05,876
Nami Ultrajarang!

245
00:18:08,003 --> 00:18:08,837
Alamak!

246
00:18:21,058 --> 00:18:23,851
<i>Tidurlah nyenyak sedikit lagi.</i>

247
00:18:23,852 --> 00:18:26,188
<i>Bila awak terjaga nanti...</i>

248
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:31,276
Tak mengapa jika kamu kekal
hilang begini, bukan?

249
00:18:32,778 --> 00:18:36,405
Mari kita mengamuk dan tinggal bersama
di sini selamanya.

250
00:18:36,406 --> 00:18:39,493
Saya tak akan jadi orang bawahan awak,
tapi, saya boleh jadi ketua awak...

251
00:18:45,916 --> 00:18:49,460
Saya tak ingat ada buat awan ini.

252
00:18:49,461 --> 00:18:51,713
Awak dah sedia, Zeus?

253
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:57,177
{\an8}Saya dah cas sepenuhnya, Nami!

254
00:18:58,011 --> 00:18:59,721
Baiklah, silakan!

255
00:19:01,348 --> 00:19:02,432
Panahan Petir!

256
00:19:04,726 --> 00:19:07,396
Mari mulakan!

257
00:19:26,748 --> 00:19:29,668
Dewa Matahari!

258
00:19:47,436 --> 00:19:50,021
Awak dah gila? Awak dah melampaulah!

259
00:19:50,022 --> 00:19:52,065
Apa awak nak buat?

260
00:19:54,902 --> 00:19:57,696
Ini hukuman suci! Saya tak boleh buat apa!

261
00:20:00,866 --> 00:20:03,535
Jelas sekali ini perbuatan awak.
Jangan berlagak bodoh.

262
00:20:05,412 --> 00:20:09,416
Baiklah! Teruskan, kucing!

263
00:20:17,925 --> 00:20:20,260
Lompat, kucing!

264
00:20:29,853 --> 00:20:32,147
Gear Empat Mini!

265
00:20:37,819 --> 00:20:41,406
Saya tak mahu pergi, tapi masanya dah tiba
untuk keluar dari Negara Blok!

266
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:43,867
Akhirnya.

267
00:20:44,451 --> 00:20:46,577
Padan muka dia, Gergasi gatal!

268
00:20:46,578 --> 00:20:49,998
Saya harap di luar ini Elbaf!

269
00:20:52,626 --> 00:20:55,629
Kuasa Getah

270
00:20:56,129 --> 00:20:58,465
Senapang Kong!

271
00:21:16,149 --> 00:21:18,277
Dapat keluar!

272
00:21:24,574 --> 00:21:30,497
AKAN BERSAMBUNG

273
00:23:05,342 --> 00:23:08,552
<i>Keluar dari Negara Blok,
Lanun Topi Jerami telah berdepan</i>

274
00:23:08,553 --> 00:23:11,931
<i>pemandangan salji yang luas
dan juga jambatan gantung gergasi.</i>

275
00:23:11,932 --> 00:23:14,142
<i>Adakah syurga atau neraka yang menanti?</i>

276
00:23:14,726 --> 00:23:20,815
<i>Sewaktu Luffy mengembara sendirian,
punca ngauman menakutkan terungkap.</i>

277
00:23:20,816 --> 00:23:22,316
<i>Episod seterusnya dalam</i> ONE PIECE!

278
00:23:22,317 --> 00:23:25,569
<i>"Pertembungan di Hamparan Salji
Loki, Sang Putera yang Dilaknat."</i>

279
00:23:25,570 --> 00:23:28,281
<i>Saya akan jadi Raja Lanun!</i>

280
00:23:30,700 --> 00:23:36,581
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Fikri D. Dali

